card.statement:
Assume $\hat B$ is stable. The screening operators $S_i$ with $i\neq0$ commute with both $E(z)$ and $\Eb(z)$:

\begin{align*}
[S_i, E(z)]=[S_i, \bs E(z)]=0, \qquad i=1,\ldots,\ell\,.
\end{align*}

For the zeroth screening we have

\begin{align*}
&[S_0,\bs E(z)]=[S_0,b_{c_1}(\bs \La_1(z)-\bs \La_1(\mu z))]\qquad &&\text{for type $\ssC$}\,,\\
&[S_0,\bs E(z)]=[S_0,b_{c_1}(\bs \La_1(z)-\bs \La_1(\mu z))+b_{c_2}(\bs \La_2(z)-\bs \La_2(\mu z))]
\qquad &&\text{for type $\ssD$}\,.
\end{align*}
